{
  "room": "reading-corner",
  "note": "The served files are bake 12 (2026-11-17, #631): bake 11's room with the ceiling cornice run on to y -13 along both side walls and along the front wall that closed it, so it meets at the front corners (bake 11 stopped at y -10 and had no front run); every texture is a new file. Bake 11 (#620) was the room closed by a front wall of its own wall pieces, the globe and the desk group moved, and the bookcase stand-in's size written into the GLB; bake 12 was baked with the command below and encoded with `encode` (ktx 4.4.2). The command below is the one bake 11 and bake 12 ran. It was first reconstructed for bake 10 (2026-11-15, carried unchanged from the prototype branch) from the transcript of the session that ran it, with --room added (spec S4.12) and --pack in place of the separate gltfpack run that followed it, which used the same arguments; the prototype branch never recorded it. `verified` is the clean-inputs check of bake 10 and of nothing since: bakes 11 and 12 have not been rerun from a clean inputs folder, and it has 16 light textures where `verified` counts 15. Refresh `inputs` and `files` with record_build.mjs.",
  "tools": {
    "blender": "5.3.0",
    "gltfpack": "1.3.0",
    "ktx": "4.4.2"
  },
  "fetch": {
    "command": "python packages/site/rooms/shared/fetch_inputs.py reading-corner",
    "handPlaced": "the Sketchfab models and the two derived PNGs in inputs.json's manual entries, placed under artifacts/rooms/reading-corner/"
  },
  "bake": {
    "command": "blender -b --factory-startup -P packages/site/rooms/shared/build_room.py -- --room reading-corner --out packages/site/public/rooms/reading-corner/room-audition.glb --chair hero --chair-height 3.45 --lamp hero --table polyhaven --candles hero --samples 512 --res 2048 --chair-res 4096 --lightmaps --rug-photo artifacts/rooms/reading-corner/derived/rug-met-446642.png --rug-span -3.7 7.14 -7.65 0.35 --rug-ruck -3.0 -5.5 --wallpaper artifacts/rooms/reading-corner/derived/wallpaper-willow.png --dress packages/site/rooms/reading-corner/dress.py --pack"
  },
  "encode": {
    "command": "node packages/site/rooms/shared/encode_ktx2.mjs reading-corner ktx"
  },
  "verified": {
    "date": "2026-11-15",
    "what": "The recorded bake command was run from a clean inputs folder (57 fetched inputs hash-checked, 11 hand-placed) into a scratch folder outside the repo, and the result compared with the served files.",
    "result": "It ran to the end and wrote a GLB of 2983572 bytes against the served 2985488, with the same 20 bake, 15 light and 5 tex textures. 5 textures are byte-identical, 31 differ from the served ones by 0.03 to 1.7 of 255 on average (Monte Carlo noise), and the lamp, chest and chair atlases are packed differently by Blender. The two GLBs drawn through one camera and one material swap look the same. A rebake is the same room and not the same bytes (ADR-0161)."
  },
